@@ -0,0 +1,395 @@
+# Copyright (c) 2012 Andy Davidoff http://www.disruptek.com/
+# Copyright (c) 2010 Jason R. Coombs http://www.jaraco.com/
+# Copyright (c) 2008 Chris Moyer http://coredumped.org/
